{
    "name": "call-frequency-max-is-density-where-min-gap-is-spacing",
    "why": "THE TWO TYPES DISAGREE ON ONE WORLD, WHICH IS WHY BOTH SHIP. p-ali takes calls on consecutive dates. One call in every three available days, measured over six consecutive days, permits two of them: density says nothing about where in the window they fall, so the pair is clean. A min_gap of three days forbids exactly that pair and reports at both placements. A department that believes these are the same rule will set one and get the other, and a corpus in which they never disagreed would let an implementation collapse one into the other unnoticed.",
